5. Beta Testing Scenario  WhatsApp Group Chat Feature

1. Verify that selected beta users can create a new group chat successfully.
2. Verify that users can add and remove group members.
3. Verify that group messages are delivered to all members correctly.
4. Verify that users receive notifications for new group messages.
5. Verify that users can share images, videos, and documents in the group chat.
6. Verify that users can leave or delete the group without any issues.
7. Verify that the group chat feature works properly on different Android and iOS devices.
8. Verify that the app does not crash while using the new group chat feature.
9. Verify that beta users can report bugs and provide feedback about the feature.
10. Verify that the group chat feature meets user expectations before the public release.
